## Fee Recipient
Address: 0x7f0C375dc32653CA5d778835ed5dC5D34d7C97cc
Purpose: Receives token deployment fees

Fees: $3 per token, $6 on Ethereum.

---

## Contract Details

### TokenFactory Features
- No-code ERC-20 token deployment
- USD-based fees converted via Chainlink price feeds
- Pausable by owner
- Configurable fee settings
- Comprehensive input validation

### BasicERC20 Features
- Standard ERC-20 implementation
- Configurable decimals (0-30)
- Initial supply minted to specified owner
- No additional minting capability (immutable supply)

---

## Compiler

- Solidity: 0.8.20
- Optimizer: Enabled (200 runs)
- EVM Version: Shanghai
- OpenZeppelin: Contracts v5 (5.4.0 components)

Built on OpenZeppelin Contracts v5; factory source code is verified on Sourcify; no independent audit.
